      Royan base

The losses you suffered during your last mission didn't go
unnoticed. You are proving expensive to us &.

Your recent maritime experience will be valuable in your
next mission.

The SASOVO fortress shelters a submarine base that is
directly menacing the regions sea-routes.

We have succeeded in setting foot on the small island SOUTH
of the continent. Sasovo is to the NORTH of the continent.

You must navigate due NORTH and land on the continent to
install several production units.

We will send you an anti-submarine prevention specialist.
His knowledge will enable you to develop an efficient fleet.

Make sure you repair your units this time, I will not pay for
the cost of your operations any longer.

Dismissed !